# Allow-list: the image only needs the Rust workspace and the web UI sources.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!web/

# Build output and local state, even inside allowed directories
**/target/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/blob-report/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
